@historical_psoe_distance
title: Keep distance from the Syndicalist Party
subtitle: Insist that UGT and PSOE are the sole legitimate representatives of the working class.
on-arrival: cnt_relation -= 10

We treat Pestaña's party as merely another splinter group. The CNT remains dominated by the  FAI and the Partido Sindicalista turns out as a not viable way, deepening the distance between social democrats and anarcho-syndicalists.

@alliance_partido_sindicalista
title: Build a electoral and trade-union alliance with Pestaña
subtitle: Leverage previous mediation to pull moderate syndicalists into the parliamentary system.
view-if: treintistas_influence >= 1
on-arrival: partido_sindicalista_allied = 1; treintistas_influence += 2; cnt_relation += 15; workers_psoe += 6; workers_ps += 1; rural_ps += 2;

Building on our prior dialogue during the 1931 strikes, Largo Caballero and Prieto support Ángel Pestaña's Partido Sindicalista. While most of the anarchist refuse to vote in elections, a minority of them change from abstention to this new party.
